sequenceDiagram
    participant Customer
    participant Landing as Landing (React)
    participant ApiCore as api-core (NestJS)
    participant PaymentSvc as payment-service (Java)
    participant PayPal
    participant Admin
    participant Mailjet
    participant BullMQ

    Customer->>Landing: Click "Buy" on prototype detail
    Landing->>ApiCore: POST /api/orders {prototype_id, customer_email}
    ApiCore->>ApiCore: Re-read price + stock from DB (server-side)
    alt Stock=0 and build_on_demand=false
        ApiCore-->>Landing: 400 - Payment blocked (out of stock)
    else Stock available or build_on_demand=true
        ApiCore->>ApiCore: Create Order(status=created)
        ApiCore->>PaymentSvc: POST /payments/orders {order_id, amount_usd, customer_email}
        PaymentSvc->>PaymentSvc: Verify idempotency_key (unique)
        PaymentSvc->>PayPal: Create PayPal order
        PayPal-->>PaymentSvc: PayPal order created
        PaymentSvc-->>ApiCore: {payment_link, payment_service_ref}
        ApiCore-->>Landing: Return payment_link
        Landing-->>Customer: Redirect to PayPal
        Customer->>PayPal: Complete payment
        PayPal->>PaymentSvc: Webhook - payment result
        PaymentSvc->>PaymentSvc: Validate signature, deduplicate
        PaymentSvc->>PaymentSvc: Payment.status = confirmed
        PaymentSvc->>PaymentSvc: Generate Receipt (customer + admin)
        PaymentSvc->>ApiCore: POST /api/orders/webhooks/payment-result {order_id, status: ok}
        ApiCore->>ApiCore: Order.status = paid_pending_acceptance
        ApiCore->>Mailjet: Send confirmation email to customer
        ApiCore->>Admin: WebSocket notification (new purchase pending)
        Note over ApiCore: Stock NOT deducted yet
    end

    Admin->>ApiCore: PATCH /api/orders/:id/accept {estimated_delivery_date}
    ApiCore->>ApiCore: Deduct stock, Order.status = accepted
    ApiCore->>ApiCore: Generate payment receipt
    ApiCore->>Mailjet: Send receipt to customer

    Admin->>ApiCore: PATCH /api/orders/:id/reject {reason}
    ApiCore->>ApiCore: Order.status = rejected
    ApiCore->>PaymentSvc: POST /payments/orders/:ref/refund {reason}
    PaymentSvc->>PayPal: POST /v2/refunds/sale/:sale_id
    PayPal-->>PaymentSvc: Refund confirmed
    PaymentSvc-->>ApiCore: Refund processed
    ApiCore->>Mailjet: Notify customer (order rejected, refund issued)

    loop Every 5 minutes
        BullMQ->>ApiCore: Reconciliation job
        ApiCore->>ApiCore: Find Orders in payment_initiated >10min
        ApiCore->>PaymentSvc: Check actual status
        PaymentSvc->>PayPal: Query order status
        ApiCore->>ApiCore: Update Order based on PayPal status
    end
